WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:02.500
In a world...

00:02.500 --> 00:05.000
where the machines can think...

00:05.000 --> 00:07.900
one man, at an undisclosed location...

00:07.900 --> 00:10.400
refused to let them decide.

00:10.400 --> 00:12.200
He built a lab.

00:12.200 --> 00:14.300
At home.

00:14.300 --> 00:15.700
Two hosts.

00:15.700 --> 00:17.300
Twenty containers.

00:17.300 --> 00:19.100
One virtual machine.

00:19.100 --> 00:22.100
And forty nine of fifty six scheduled jobs.

00:22.100 --> 00:24.700
The other seven... are on a break.

00:24.700 --> 00:26.000
But in the dark...

00:26.000 --> 00:27.450
something stirred.

00:27.450 --> 00:29.400
A cloud subscription.

00:29.400 --> 00:31.300
There is no cancel button.

00:31.300 --> 00:33.900
Only one crew could stand against it.

00:33.900 --> 00:37.100
Meet the machines.

00:42.300 --> 00:43.500
This October.

00:43.500 --> 00:45.500
A hobby lab folds space...

00:45.500 --> 00:47.600
to keep the lights on.

00:47.600 --> 00:50.800
House Cashio.

00:51.000 --> 00:53.600
Rated MH. Mostly harmless.

00:53.600 --> 00:56.800
Don't panic. Say hello, at cashio.us.

00:57.300 --> 00:58.950
No clouds were harmed.

00:58.950 --> 01:01.000
One was slightly inconvenienced.
